  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After rival executives threaten Unit One behind closed doors, Chun Yuqiao calls Bu Xiaogu into his office. She arrives brimming with production questions, unaware that he is about to shield her by sending her back to administration. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事跟你说，你有空吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，我攒了好多个问题想要问你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您有什么任务您先说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先解决你的问题吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？我前两天看资料想到这些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你笑什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "问题提得挺好的，不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这边有好多活还得干呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷，你跟雷总回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你答应过我的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我改变主意了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "打扰了，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事跟你说，你有空吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have something to tell you; are you free?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，我攒了好多个问题想要问你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful, I have saved up plenty of questions I want to ask you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您有什么任务您先说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, if you have an assignment, please go ahead first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先解决你的问题吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us address your questions first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？我前两天看资料想到这些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really? I thought of these a couple of days ago while reading the files.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你笑什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you smiling?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "问题提得挺好的，不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your questions are very well put, not bad at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这边有好多活还得干呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is still so much work to be done over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷，你跟雷总回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, go back with Director Lei.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你答应过我的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, you promised me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我改变主意了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I changed my mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "打扰了，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me for disturbing you, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
